hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1054","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aaya jabke merey sath Ashaariyon mein se do aadmi they. To main ne kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom tha ke wo kaam maangtey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Ham apne kaam par use muqarrar na karengey jo usey maangey. (Bukhari: 2261)"
"1055","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne bakriyaan charaaein. To Aap key sahaaba ne kaha: Aur Aap? To Aap ne farmaya: Haan, main Makkah walon key liye qeeraaton key badley charaata tha. (Bukhari: 2262)"
"1056","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalmaanon aur Yahood aur Nasaara ki misaal aisey aadmi jaisi hai jis ne qaum ko mazdoori par rakha ke wo uskey liye din se raat tak maaloom ujrat par kaam karein. To unhon-ne uskey liye aadhey din tak kaam kya aur kaha: Hamein tumhaari ujrat ki haajat nahi hai jo tum ne hamaarey liye muqarrar ki thi. Aur jo ham ne kya wo zaaya hai. To us ne un se kaha: Aisa na karo. Apne baaqi kaam ko poora karo aur apni poori ujrat lo. To unhon-ne inkaar kya aur chhor diya. Aur us ne unkey baad do mazdoor mazdoori par rakkhey aur un donon se kaha: Apne is baaqi din ko poora karo aur tum donon key liye wo hai jo main ne unkey liye ujrat mein muqarrar kya tha. To unhon-ne kaam kya yahan tak ke jab Asr ki namaz ka waqt tha to unhon-ne kaha: Jo ham ne kya wo tumharey liye zaaya hai aur jo ujrat tum ne us mein hamaarey liye rakhi thi. To us ne un donon se kaha: Apne baaqi kaam ko poora karo, din mein bahut thoda baaqi hai. To unhon-ne inkaar kya. Aur us ne qaum ko mazdoori par rakha ke wo uskey liye uskey baaqi din kaam karein. To unhon-ne apne baaqi din kaam kya yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho gaya. Aur donon girohon ka poora ajr poora kar liya. To wo unki misaal hai aur jo unhon-ne is noor mein se qabool kya uski misaal hai. (Bukhari: 2271)"
"1057","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum se pehlon mein se teen giroh nikley yahan tak ke wo raat guzaarney key liye ghaar mein aey aur us mein daakhil huey. To pahaad se chattaan giri aur un par ghaar band kar diya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tumhey is chattaan se koi najaat na dega magar ye ke tum Allah se apne nek aamaal key sath dua karo. To un mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey budhey badey maan baap they. Aur main un se pehley ghar walon aur maal ko shaam ka doodh na pilaata tha. To mujhey aik din kisi cheez ki talaash mein door jaana pada. To main un par shaam tak na aaya yahan tak ke wo so gaey. To main ne unkey liye unka shaam ka doodh doha. To unhey soya hua paaya. Aur main ne naapasand kya ke un se pehley ghar walon ya maal ko shaam ka doodh pilaaun. To main thehra raha jabke pyaala merey haath mein tha, unkey jaagney ka intezaar kartey huey yahan tak ke Fajr chamki. To wo jaagey aur unhon-ne apna shaam ka doodh piya. Ae Allah! Agar main ne wo terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushada kar de jo ham is chattaan mein hain. To wo thodi khul gai ke wo nikal na saktey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur doosrey ne kaha: Ae Allah! Meri chacha zaad behan thi jo mujhey logon mein sab se zyada mehboob thi. To main ne use uski zaat se chaaha aur us ne mujh se inkaar kya. Yahan tak ke use saalon mein se aik saal mein sakhti pahunchi. To wo merey paas aai aur main ne use aik sau bees deenaar diye is par ke wo merey aur uski zaat key darmiyaan rukawat hata dey. To us ne aisa kya. Yahan tak ke jab main us par qaadir hua to us ne kaha: Tumhaarey liye halaal nahi ke mohar ko baghair haq key todo. To main us par waaqe honay se dara aur us se wapas aaya jabke wo mujhey logon mein sab se zyada mehboob thi. Aur jo sona main ne use diya tha chhor diya. Ae Allah! Agar main ne terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushada kar de jo ham is mein hain. To chattaan khul gai, magar ye ke wo us se nikal na saktey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur teesrey ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne mazdoor mazdoori par rakkhey aur unhey unki ujrat di, magar aik aadmi key siwa jis ne jo uska tha chhoda aur chala gaya. To main ne uski ujrat badhaai yahan tak ke us se maal bahut ho gaey. To wo merey paas muddat key baad aaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Meri ujrat dey. To main ne us se kaha: Jo tum dekhtey ho tumhaari ujrat mein se, oonton aur gaayon aur bakriyon aur ghulaamon mein se. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Mujh se mazaak na karo. To main ne kaha: Beshak main tum se mazaak nahi karta. To us ne use sab liya aur haank ley gaya aur us mein se kuchh na chhoda. Ae Allah! Phir agar main ne wo terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushada kar de jo ham is mein hain. To chattaan khul gai aur wo paidal nikaley. (Bukhari: 2272)"
"1058","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se giroh safar mein nikla jo unhon-ne kya tha yahan tak ke Arbon key qabeelon mein se aik qabeelay par utrey. To unhon-ne un se mehmaani maangi aur unhon-ne unki mehmaani se inkaar kya. To us qabeelay ka sardaar dasa gaya. To uskey liye har cheez se koshish ki jo use faeda na deti. To baaz ne kaha: Kaash tum in giroh key paas aao jo utrey hain, shayed un mein se baaz key paas kuchh ho. To wo unkey paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae giroh! Beshak hamaara sardaar dasa gaya hai aur ham ne uskey liye har cheez se koshish ki jo use faeda nahi deti. To kya tum mein se kisi key paas kuchh hai? To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main dam karta hun. Lekin Allah ki qasam! Beshak ham ne tum se mehmaani maangi aur tum ne hamaari mehmaani na ki. To main tum par dam karney wala nahi hun yahan tak ke tum hamaarey liye ujrat rakkho. To unhon-ne un se bakriyon key rewad par sulah ki. To wo us par thookta hua gaya aur (Alhamdu lillahi Rabbil Aalameen) padhta hua. To goya wo rassi se khol diya gaya. To wo chalney laga jabke usey dard na tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne unhey unki ujrat poori di jis par unhon-ne un se sulah ki thi. To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Taqseem karo. To jis ne dam kya tha us ne kaha: Aisa na karo yahan tak ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein aur Aap se jo hua tha zikr karein aur dekhein ke Aap hamein kya hukm detey hain. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhey kya maloom ke wo dam hai? Phir farmaya: Beshak tum ne durust paaya hai. Taqseem karo aur merey liye tumharey sath hissa rakkho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansay. (Bukhari: 2276)"
"1059","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saannd ki jima ki ujrat se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2284). Hawaalon ki kitaab."
